  "review": {
    "official": "Nearl, once known as the\nRadiant Knight\nof\nKazimierz\n, is a member of the\nInfected\nsupport group, \"Followers\". She has demonstrated remarkable combat techniques and military discipline, whether it's covering allies, mobile warfare, all-out assault or field battle.\nCurrently a heavy-weapon\nOperator\nfor\nRhodes Island\nand provides command and combat support in person.",
